# Breezy Does It (levels/solo/breezy.txt), the Giant Steps route. Fans and floors that won't
# wait: hop the bump, float over the fan dip, hop the crumbling bridge's hole; float on the
# sewage fans from one crumbling stone to the next; hop the headwind bridge before it drops;
# jump up into the vent's gust. At the fork take the high lane: crumbling stones a toot apart
# (five toots since the sewage), call the band (Down) and step into the fan pit: the band
# turns, the fan blows twice as far and lifts Nat onto the rooftop. Up there: hop the hole in
# the crumbling bridge, one jump over the spikes under the spiky ceiling (no toot!), jump into
# the gust and toot late to scoop the best nuggets under the spikes, hop the crumbling stones,
# drop to the bank. Then the long-reach fans carry him over the last stretch: a fan, a
# crumbling ledge, a fan, the mesa, a fan, a crumbling stone, the vent's gust, the climb out.
